# Local working artifacts: code-review outputs and superpowers plans/specs.
# Design rationale worth keeping has been folded into THEORY.md.
# Note the `docs/*` (not `docs/`) form: git does not descend into an excluded
# directory, so a `!docs/adr/` negation under `docs/` would never be consulted.
docs/*
# ...except the decision log, which IS a tracked repo artifact: one file per
# decision plus a generated index (see docs/adr/README.md).
!docs/adr/

# cProfile dumps written by `just profile --save` (bench/profile_hotspots.py).
bench/.profiles/
